  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -IR verb with e→i stem change",
    "Stem change applies in presente (all forms except nosotros/nosotras): *despido, despides, despide, despiden*",
    "In pretérito indefinido, e→i in 3rd person only: *se despidió, se despidieron*",
    "In subjuntivo, e→i applies to nosotros too (all -IR e→i verbs): *nos despidamos*",
    "Past participle: despedido (regular)",
    "*Me despido de mis amigos en el aeropuerto* = I say goodbye to my friends at the airport",
    "Non-reflexive: *despedir* = to fire/dismiss someone (*Lo despidieron del trabajo* = They fired him from his job)",
    "Related: la despedida (farewell, goodbye), despedida de soltero/a (stag/hen party)"
  ],
